{"slug":"Leetcode-322-Coin-Change","title":"Leetcode#322. Coin Change","date":"2024-06-30","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","Array","Dynamic Programming","Breadth-First Search","💡"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"You are given an integer array representing coins of different denominations and an integer representing a total amount of money. Return the fewest number of coins that you need to make up that amount","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>You are given an integer array <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>coins</span></span></code></span> representing coins of different denominations and an integer <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>amount</span></span></code></span> representing a total amount of money.</p>\n<p>Return <em>the fewest number of coins that you need to make up that amount</em>. If that amount of money cannot be made up by any combination of the coins, return <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-1</span></span></code></span>.</p>\n<p>You may assume that you have an infinite number of each kind of coin.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: coins = [1,2,5], amount = 11</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation: 11 = 5 + 5 + 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: coins = [2], amount = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: -1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: coins = [1], amount = 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= coins.length &#x3C;= 12</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= coins[i] &#x3C;= 231 - 1</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>0 &#x3C;= amount &#x3C;= 104</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> coinChange</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">coins</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        dp </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [ amount </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> ]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">*</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(amount </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        dp[</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( amount</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> ):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> coin </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> coins:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> coin </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                    dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(dp[i] , </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dp[ i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> coin ])</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dp[ amount ] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dp[amount]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span></code></pre></figure>"}